  "rules": {
    "notes": [
      "Fidelity pass rule: \"Pass: no element below 2, and elements 1, 4, 7, 9, 10 and 11 at 3.\" (docs/concepts/vr-light-table/art-breakdown.md:72)",
      "Poly budget is per asset: tris at or under the manifest's budget_tris, summed over meshes, the largest mesh when budget_note says \"per mesh\" (scripts/check-art.mjs (c)); no per-class budget is stated",
      "P4 per-asset guide (triangles): Lamp agent: head, two-joint arm, base 30k; Light table frame 10k; Survey pin 500, instanced; Studio kit (shelves, desk lamp, mug, drawing tubes, pinned drawings) 80k total (docs/concepts/vr-light-table/plan.md:520); a manifest's budget_tris supersedes it",
      "Every manifest carries gates input, mesh_acceptance, scale, finishing, poly_budget, each pass: true (apps/vr/ArtSource/*/manifest.json; scripts/check-art.mjs (b))",
      "Class material also carries gate tiling (apps/vr/ArtSource/*/manifest.json)",
      "Each asset passes the same chain, from the registry: concept sheet, then an input gate (reconstructability), then TRELLIS.2, then mesh acceptance, scale normalisation, finishing (low-poly retopology and UV, PBR baked), a poly budget, and finally UE import through the editor MCP. (docs/concepts/vr-light-table/plan.md:514)",
      "Scene budget for the whole slice, borrowed from mage-arena's numbers as a start and re-measured in P3: 150 draw calls and 350k visible triangles or fewer. (docs/concepts/vr-light-table/plan.md:527)",
      "Prop sheets for image-to-3D follow the registry's input gating, not the style block: one object, plain neutral background, canonical pose, even light, no text on the object, the object whole and uncropped. A beautiful prop image that breaks those rules is rejected before TRELLIS.2 runs. (docs/concepts/vr-light-table/art-breakdown.md:57)",
      "Style block, Palette with roles: ground: blueprint blue `#0B2A6B` to `#123A8C`; linework, volumes and the scan band: cyan-white `#BFE8FF`; attention (pins, agent head): amber `#FFB547`; decision accents: warm paper `#F3E9D2`; studio: near-black blue `#0A0F18` (docs/concepts/vr-light-table/art-breakdown.md:53)",
      "Style block, Finish: soft bloom on edges, light haze, warm practical lights against a cool table, slight film grain (docs/concepts/vr-light-table/art-breakdown.md:54)",
      "Style block, Never: galaxy or star imagery, neon cyberpunk clutter, fisheye, readable fake text, purple gradients (docs/concepts/vr-light-table/art-breakdown.md:55)",
      "Texture convention: 8 of 14 manifests with a textures entry pack ORM as R occlusion, G roughness, B metal, with a tangent-space OpenGL normal (apps/vr/ArtSource/*/manifest.json textures)"
    ]
  },
